ys.size,one_character_aliases:pairs.filter(p=>p.alias.length===1).length,two_character_aliases:pairs.filter(p=>p.alias.length===2).length,reversible:true,pairs},null,2));\nconsole.log('ALIAS_MAPPING_END');\nNODE",
